  {
    "id": "b96c0affc7b93d4fda22284da54aeb14a4b05d72",
    "individual_note": true,
    "resolvable": false,
    "notes": [
      {
        "id": 3954483195,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Planned as phase 5 of [Object save fixes and arm pricing](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/master/docs/ongoing-projects/object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing.md).\n\nIt runs after #16, never beside it: both change the leaving save's extraction in `src/obj/objsave.c`. The plan stores a sheath's weapons as the pet's own objects, as a house save does, so it needs no new table and no migration.\n\nIts `17-` branch is created from master when the phase starts. The work runs in the worktree `Luminari-Source-object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing`, now on phase 1 (#19).",
        "author": {
          "id": 42759441,
          "username": "max757",
          "public_email": "",
          "name": "Max aka Mosheh",
          "state": "active",
          "locked": false,
          "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3c7c169343bd7d0f4575137ce8065aee7cb44024d447bbfe66d773133a81c43e?s=80&d=identicon",
