        "id": 3972359876,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Next up: phase 5 of\n[Object save fixes and arm pricing](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/master/docs/ongoing-projects/object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing.md).\n#16 (phase 4), which shares the leaving save's extraction with this item, merged on 2026-10-07 as\n`f26c9b0ed`.\n\nThe branch `17-a-loaded-sheath-loses-its-weapons-on-a-pet-and-leaks-them-when-extracted` was\ncreated from master `0b88bb81d` on 2026-10-07, and the worktree\n`Luminari-Source-object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing` is on it. No code yet.",
